# u22 pass 4: Tuba, top line, real pitch then up an octave where below 95 Hz (tensions = targets: in-phrase the tuba tracks its tension)
# second run (fart_v1): tensions re-derived at push 0.9 (probe inversion, tone 0.4), then per-note corrected from render 2;
# notes that did not swing in render 2 are rests of the same length; the rest of the pass-4 header stands.
# review: sustained notes (last four lines) take probe tensions, half notes keep target tensions
# tongue off (slur). Notes below 95 Hz moved up an octave. Notes the valve did not tune in pass 3 (no swing, or more than 100 cents off) are rests of the same length.
